lines:
我听说了！你真强！{be01}
我们一直在这儿争论
谁是最强的训练家，{be01}
当我听说你的时候，
我就准备做你的粉丝
！{be01}
我想看你继续跟其他
强大的训练家对战，{be01}
这样我们就能看到你
对战的英姿，{be01}
然后大家都能了解你
有多么强大。{be01}
我会一直支持你的，{0100:0}
！

I hate to say this, but the Trainer
everybody’s talking about is{be00}
Phoebe, no question about it!{be01}
That Trainer’s power...
It’s out of the ordinary.

Sigh...
Brawly...{be01}
Oh, no! Wait!
That’s not right! No, no, no!{be01}
I’m your fan through and through!{be01}
So make me proud!
Go for it!

Nobody understands the charm of
Brawly...{be01}
I don’t care!{be01}
Even if I’m the only one, I’m going
to keep cheering for Brawly!

Norman battled with more power,
charisma, and showmanship than you.{be01}
Even though people may say that
you’re strong...{be01}
You’ve still got a long way to go
compared to your father.

即使遇到挫折，你的
父亲也不会放弃，{be01}
我相信这点。{be01}
就算你输了，也不要
气馁！坚持战斗下去
！

我一直支持你，{0100:0}！一
直都会！{be01}
我不想看到你输掉，{0100:0}
，{be01}
因为我知道你真的非
常非常强，{0100:0}！

My favorite Trainer is...{be01}
Cool...{be01}
Strong...{be01}
And really nice...{be01}
I wish there was a Trainer like that...

Even if I’m the only one...{be01}
You’ll always be the only one I
cheer for, {0100:0}!{be01}
Because I believe in you, {0100:0}!

Even if I’m the only one...{be01}
I’m never going to stop being
Steven’s fan!{be01}
Because I’ve heard, Steven
never loses!

You’re a pretty decent Trainer,
I think.{be01}
But I also think that Wallace
is number one right now.{be01}
That’s just my opinion.
Don’t worry about it too much.

{0100:0}！还是你最出色！{be01}
我已看到你就知道你
会是最棒的，{be01}
我的眼光没错。

Wow, you really are strong.
Maybe even stronger than Wallace.{be01}
But Wallace needs me.{be01}
If I don’t cheer for Wallace,
who will?

Among the recently hot Trainers,
Glacia is the standout.{be01}
That toughness, it’s simply not normal.{be01}
You’re doing okay, but you’re not in
the same class as Glacia.

You are really popular...{be01}
You’re strong, and you’re caring to
Pokémon. No one can knock you.{be01}
But, you know, I believe in Glacia.{be01}
Glacia is definitely stronger!
I’m positive!

是的，我在你眼中看
到了力量，{be01}
但是……{be01}
你还未发掘出自己的
潜力。

It is true that you are tremendously
powerful.{be01}
But!
I can tell...{be01}
That strength cannot be considered
true strength yet!{be01}
True strength is...!
... ...{be01}
Actually, I have no idea, either.
